 rides, and activities.","source_url":"https://www.smu.edu/admission/experience/spirit-traditions","source_title":"Celebrate SMU: History, Mascot, and Traditions | SMU","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A spring event; confirm the current date, location, and entry details with SMU programming.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"smu-celebration-of-lights","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Celebration of Lights","title":"Wait for Dallas Hall to Light Up","subtitle":"Holiday season • Dallas Hall Lawn","notes":"Gather on the Dallas Hall lawn for student carols, then stay through “Silent Night” for the lighting of the building.","short_summary":"Dallas Hall's holiday illumination is the finale of SMU's seasonal community gathering.","evidence_claim":"SMU says Celebration of Lights gathers the community for carols and concludes with the lighting of Dallas Hall after “Silent Night.”","source_url":"https://www.smu.edu/admission/experience/spirit-traditions","source_title":"Celebrate SMU: History, Mascot, and Traditions | SMU","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A holiday-season event; verify the current program details before attending.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"smu-diamond-m-formation","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Mustang Band “Diamond M” Formation","title":"Spot the “Diamond M”","subtitle":"SMU football game performances","notes":"At a football game, watch the Mustang Band's field presentation for its documented “Diamond M” formation and feature twirler.","short_summary":"The Mustang Band's signature field formation turns the SMU initial into a diamond-shaped M.","evidence_claim":"SMU identifies the Mustang Band's “Diamond M” formation as part 